 166:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_interpolate_q31.c ****         /* Upsampling is done by stuffing L-1 zeros between each sample.
 167:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_fir_interpolate_q31.c ****          * So instead of multiplying zeros with coefficients,
